{"id":"n71218-1-2","stage":0,"title":"저기 · 那里","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71218-1-2-1","ko":"저기 맞지? 우리가 처음 만났던 곳 말이야.","zh":"就是那儿对吧？我们第一次见面的那个地方。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저기","meaning":"那里，那儿","explanation":"저기：那里，那儿。","readings":[{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71218","senseId":"1","lemma":"저기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}},{"text":"맞지?","meaning":"对","explanation":"맞다：对；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66231","senseId":"3","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맞지","audio":"/audio/5d4235aa419751df148a.mp3"}},{"text":"우리가","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리가","audio":"/audio/49bdae052f6acaf1e2d7.mp3"}},{"text":"처음","meaning":"第一次，初次","explanation":"처음：第一次，初次。","readings":[{"term":"처음","audio":"/audio/91390eadfad43d09c458.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17170","senseId":"1","lemma":"처음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"처음","audio":"/audio/91390eadfad43d09c458.mp3"}},{"text":"만났던","meaning":"第一次见过的","explanation":"만나다：见面；-았던 回忆过去发生过的见面，修饰后面的 곳。","readings":[{"term":"만나다","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66591","senseId":"2","lemma":"만나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만났던","audio":"/audio/8a2b1c881038bc3ca4a6.mp3"}},{"text":"곳","meaning":"地方，地区","explanation":"곳：地方，地区。","readings":[{"term":"곳","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18661","senseId":"1","lemma":"곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese di